private boolean isGray(PDColorSpace colorSpace) {
    if (colorSpace instanceof PDDeviceGray) {
        return true;
    }
    if (colorSpace instanceof PDICCBased) {
        try {
            return ((PDICCBased) (colorSpace)).getAlternateColorSpace() instanceof PDDeviceGray;
        } catch (IOException ex) // PATH: Test should invoke the next Log.debug(...) [step in execution path]
        {
            LOG.debug("Couldn't get an alternate ColorSpace", ex);
            return false;
        }
    }
    return false;
}

Hard constraints:
- The test class MUST NOT extend any other class (no 'extends' keyword).
- The test class MUST NOT override any methods (no @Override annotations).
- Do NOT create anonymous inner classes (e.g., new ClassName() { ... }).
- Use real objects whenever possible.
